      "content": "It sounds like you are going through a really painful period of creative burnout and self-doubt right now. Please know that these feelings of emptiness and feeling like a fraud are incredibly common, especially when you value your creativity so much. Be gentle with yourself; creative wells can run low, and that doesn't mean the well is gone forever. If these feelings are overwhelming, reaching out to a mental health professional can provide immense support during this low moment.",
